{"EN": "You may have heard of this story before...", "PTBR": "Você já deve ter ouvido esta história antes...", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L1", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 1, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "There was once a prince", "PTBR": "Era uma vez um príncipe", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L2", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 2, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Who had his shape changed into", "PTBR": "Que teve sua forma trocada por", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L3", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 3, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "That of an ugly beast by a witch", "PTBR": "A de uma fera feia por uma bruxa", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L4", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 4, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Desparing of his bloodcurdling appearince", "PTBR": "Desesperado com sua aparência arrepiante", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L5", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 5, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "He hid himself in a forest far from his kingdom", "PTBR": "Escondeu-se numa floresta longe do seu reino", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L6", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 6, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "One day", "PTBR": "Um dia", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L7", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 7, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "A woman rushed into his hut", "PTBR": "Uma mulher invadiu sua cabana", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L8", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 8, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "And passed out", "PTBR": "E desmaiou", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L9", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 9, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Having been badly wounded by a pack of wolves", "PTBR": "Muito ferida por uma alcateia de lobos", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L10", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 10, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "He treated her with the knowledge", "PTBR": "Ele a tratou com o conhecimento", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L11", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 11, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "And fear that his ugly body might scare her", "PTBR": "E o temor de que seu corpo feio a assustasse", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L12", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 12, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "This fear turned into reality soon enough", "PTBR": "Esse temor logo virou realidade", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L13", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 13, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "For she cried out as she woke up", "PTBR": "Pois ela gritou ao acordar", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L14", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 14, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "However, as days passed by", "PTBR": "Porém, com a passagem dos dias", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L15", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 15, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "And she regained her health", "PTBR": "E ela recompôs a saúde", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L16", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 16, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "The woman had come to recognize the kindness", "PTBR": "A mulher passou a reconhecer a bondade", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L17", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 17, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "And generosity that was within the heart of this beast ", "PTBR": "E a generosidade no coração desta fera ", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L18", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 18, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "She decided to live with him", "PTBR": "Decidiu viver com ele", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L19", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 19, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "They surmounted various difficulties throughout their lives", "PTBR": "Venceram várias dificuldades ao longo das vidas", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L20", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 20, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "And the story comes to an end", "PTBR": "E a história chega ao fim", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L21", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 21, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "When the curse set upon the prince finally breaks", "PTBR": "Quando a maldição sobre o príncipe finalmente se rompe", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L22", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 22, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "And the beast returned to his former shape", "PTBR": "E a fera volta à sua forma antiga", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L23", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 23, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "That of a flawlessly handsome prince ", "PTBR": "A de um príncipe impecavelmente belo ", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L24", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 24, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "The two of them got along very well from that time on", "PTBR": "Os dois se deram muito bem a partir daí", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L25", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 25, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "A happy ending... ", "PTBR": "Um final feliz... ", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L26", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 26, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Although just an ordinary story", "PTBR": "Embora seja só uma história comum", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L27", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 27, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Don't you agree?", "PTBR": "Não acha?", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L28", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 28, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "The elders of Vindale used to tell me this kind of story", "PTBR": "Os anciãos de Vindale costumavam me contar esse tipo de história", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L29", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 29, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "But I never liked this one", "PTBR": "Mas eu nunca gostei desta", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L30", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 30, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Perhaps it is because I felt like the beast that she loved", "PTBR": "Talvez porque eu me sentia como a fera que ela amou", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L31", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 31, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Despite the fact that his ugliness", "PTBR": "Apesar de que a feiúra dele", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L32", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 32, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Had been left behind somewhere", "PTBR": "Havia ficado esquecida em algum lugar", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L33", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 33, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "You know the fairy tale", "PTBR": "Conhece o conto de fadas", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L34", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 34, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Where a wicked witch transforms a dashing prince into an monster?", "PTBR": "Em que uma bruxa má transforma um príncipe galã num monstro?", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L35", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 35, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "(The stunning beauty of Elea's face halts your step a moment)", "PTBR": "(A beleza estonteante do rosto da Elea prende seu passo por um momento)", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L36", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 36, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "The world is thrown into bedlam and chaos", "PTBR": "O mundo é lançado em alvoroço e caos", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L37", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 37, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "We must remain strong in the face of it", "PTBR": "Temos de permanecer fortes diante dela", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L38", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 38, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "The man we saw in Vernis he just might be...", "PTBR": "O homem que vimos em Vernis, ele pode muito bem ser...", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L39", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 39, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Someone mutters in mysterious ancient language", "PTBR": "Alguém murmura em uma antiga língua misteriosa", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L40", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 40, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Eleas is already being regarded as a heretic ", "PTBR": "Os Elea já são tidos como hereges ", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L41", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 41, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Your lofty dignity isn't helping this", "PTBR": "Sua altiva dignidade não ajuda nisso", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L42", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 42, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Do we really have to fight?", "PTBR": "A gente precisa mesmo lutar?", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L43", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 43, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
{"EN": "Sorry I don't have time for this", "PTBR": "Desculpa, não tenho tempo para isso", "fallback": false, "file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "gender": {"addressee": "unknown", "referent": "unknown", "speaker": "unknown"}, "id": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt::L44", "kind": "txt_line", "line": 44, "source_file": "Widget/Nenene/default.txt", "tokens": []}
